export anchor PageTabsStyle:
    number: 200
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Page tabs
    idea: A white workspace organised by page tabs, Overview, Projects and Activity, with segmented controls for views, a single stat strip and compact teal-accented cards.
    base: light
    palette:
        page: #ffffff, the workspace and cards
        subtle: #f6f7f8, the search field and the style sheet
        segment: #eceef1, the segmented control track and tab counts
        line: #dfe2e6, card borders, the stat strip and the tab rule
        text: #1c1f24, body text and the current nav item
        muted: #5d646e, labels, idle tabs and meta
        teal: #0e6b63, the current tab, primary button, this week bars and focus
        tealSoft: #e2f1ef, avatars and the current tab count
        lastWeek: #7b9894, last week bars
        ok: #1b7543, On track outlined tag with a check circle
        risk: #885200, At risk outlined tag with a triangle
        behind: #b3261e, Behind tag with a crossed square and the overdue figure
        behindSoft: #fbe9e7, the overdue chip
    type:
        One stack, Segoe UI Variable Text, Segoe UI, system-ui, -apple-system,
        Roboto, Helvetica Neue, Arial, sans-serif. The
        greeting is 24px at 650, stat values 28px at 650 tabular, card
        titles 15px at 650, tabs 14px with the current one at 650, body
        14px at 1.5, segments 12.5px and bar values 11px.
    layout:
        A 56px white app bar with a bottom rule holds a teal round B mark
        and the brand, six nav links with Home underlined in dark text, a
        grey search field with a slash key hint, a teal New project button,
        a bell and the initials disc with the name. Under it the page head
        shows a small Home crumb, the greeting, the date and a pale red
        overdue chip with a clock. A tab row follows with Overview current
        in teal with a teal underline, then Projects and Activity each with
        a count pill. The Overview content starts with one bordered stat
        strip split into four cells by vertical rules, each an icon label
        and a value with a short grey note, overdue in red. Next a two to
        one row puts a chart card on the left, with a Daily and Weekly
        segmented control, week totals and fourteen bars with values on
        top and a rule between the weeks, beside a dense activity card
        with times right aligned. Last comes a projects card with a Cards
        and List segmented control and a three by two grid of small
        bordered project cards. Below 1100px the nav moves to a second row,
        the cards go two across and the chart row stacks. On phones the
        strip is two by two and the cards stack.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 24px gutters and gaps, 16 to 20px card padding and 12px between project cards.
    density: Compact. 14px body, 34px controls and a value printed on every bar.
    corners: 8px cards and the stat strip, 6px buttons and fields, 7px segment track and 4px tags.
    borders: 1px #dfe2e6 on every card. The stat strip is one bordered box split by vertical rules. Status tags are outlined in their own colour.
    shadows: Only the selected segment gets 0 1px 2px. Cards are flat.
    icons:
        18px line icons at 1.8 stroke on stat labels and the bar. Status
        tags use a check circle, a triangle or a crossed square with the
        word.
    focus: A 2px teal outline offset 2px. A segment shows its focus on the inner pill.
    tone: Short labels, such as Overview, Recent activity, Daily and Weekly.
